### ==============================================================================
### MEDIA GALLERY APIS (Photos & Videos)
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@adminToken = REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_BEARER_TOKEN
@adminSecretKey = BYK_SUPER_ADMIN_ALIGARH_SECRET_2026

### 1. List Gallery Media (category=photo or video)
GET {{baseUrl}}/gallery?category=photo

### 2. Add Media to Gallery
POST {{baseUrl}}/gallery
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
x-admin-secret-key: {{adminSecretKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Tree Plantation Drive by Youth Volunteers",
  "category": "photo",
  "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542601906990-b4d3fb778b09?w=600",
  "caption": "Over 500 saplings planted across public parks in Aligarh.",
  "eventDate": "2026-09-25"
}

### 3. Delete Media from Gallery
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/gallery/GALLERY_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
x-admin-secret-key: {{adminSecretKey}}
